3,"Garasia, Adiwasi Language (GAS)... | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/gas/,"Adiwasi Garasia is a stable indigenous language of India. It belongs to the Indo-European language family. Direct evidence is lacking, but the language is thought to be used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.","Garasia, Adiwasi",Indo-European
